(7730590, 1273341, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top five for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top five for this challenge.', '2022-10-02 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730591, 1273334, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top five for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top five for this challenge.', '2022-10-02 10:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730592, 1273197, 42733, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. In my top five for this challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea. In my top five for this challenge.', '2022-10-02 10:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730593, 1273333, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top five for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top five for this challenge.', '2022-10-02 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730604, 1273129, 173844, '<td valign="top">This flat plain blossoms into a bounty of lines, as per the challenge, and also gives so much more delight.  The road and verge lead to a vanishing point.  Then there are the fence lines and the vertical lines of the storm issuing from a horizontal feast of clouds.  Very "North By Northwest"-ish.  The varied parts nicely come together.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This flat plain blossoms into a bounty of lines, as per the challenge, and also gives so much more delight.  The road and verge lead to a vanishing point.  Then there are the fence lines and the vertical lines of the storm issuing from a horizontal feast of clouds.  Very "North By Northwest"-ish.  The varied parts nicely come together.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-10-03 00:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730605, 1273349, 173844, '<td valign="top">So many interesting ways to construct a leading line.  Gritty and mesmerizing. The out of focus foreground - I like it - launches the viewer into far distance.  The lights are especially entrancing.  Seems to carry a mysterious weight beyond cars and trucks.<br/>Handsome.</td>', 'So many interesting ways to construct a leading line.  Gritty and mesmerizing. The out of focus foreground - I like it - launches the viewer into far distance.  The lights are especially entrancing.  Seems to carry a mysterious weight beyond cars and trucks.Handsome.', '2022-10-03 00:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730606, 1273342, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image has a charming musical quality, flutes and percussion.  The sunlight and shadows dance along the architecture.  It also has a maze-like feel.  Clean and compelling.  Fine photograph.</td>', 'This image has a charming musical quality, flutes and percussion.  The sunlight and shadows dance along the architecture.  It also has a maze-like feel.  Clean and compelling.  Fine photograph.', '2022-10-03 00:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730609, 1273255, 114285, '<td valign="top">Yes the horizon I thought about mentioning that but thought It was a little bit picky. Im quite astonished that this did not score higher. There are leading lines everywhere. Such a sweet little image with the father holding the boys hand. Well I assume he is the father.</td>', 'Yes the horizon I thought about mentioning that but thought It was a little bit picky. Im quite astonished that this did not score higher. There are leading lines everywhere. Such a sweet little image with the father holding the boys hand. Well I assume he is the father.', '2022-10-03 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730611, 1273129, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow its been nearly 4 years since your last ribbon :)<br/> <br/>And yes black-and-white was an excellent choice.<br/> <br/>Congratulations, huge fan of those clouds, and the stream of rain pouring down.</td>', 'Wow its been nearly 4 years since your last ribbon :) And yes black-and-white was an excellent choice. Congratulations, huge fan of those clouds, and the stream of rain pouring down.', '2022-10-03 01:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730623, 1273333, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Glad to see you''re still here. You make me want to come back.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Glad to see you''re still here. You make me want to come back.', '2022-10-03 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730627, 1273129, 2333, '<td valign="top">Really gratifying to get a ribbon for this one given that being in the right place to get this shot was purely chance, but also given that there were some really outstanding shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Really gratifying to get a ribbon for this one given that being in the right place to get this shot was purely chance, but also given that there were some really outstanding shots in this challenge.', '2022-10-03 11:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730629, 1273105, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  It was a little bit subtle, but I thought strong enough to make Top 10.  Got dinged by the non-participants.  Guess it (leading lines) wasn''t obvious enough.</td>', 'Hmm.  It was a little bit subtle, but I thought strong enough to make Top 10.  Got dinged by the non-participants.  Guess it (leading lines) wasn''t obvious enough.', '2022-10-03 12:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
